Title: Neon Horizon - Revision 2
Credit: Written by
Author: Director
Draft date: 2026-10-01

# Verse 1

.ABANDONED WAREHOUSE - NIGHT #1#
= Rain-soaked pavement reflecting cyan neon signs. Singer steps slowly out of shadow into the puddle reflections.
[[Camera: 35mm anamorphic, slow push in, shallow depth of field]]
MARCUS
(singing)
Walking through the midnight haze.

# Chorus

.ROOFTOP HELIPAD - NIGHT #2#
= High-energy magenta strobe lights pulsing. Dancers perform acrobatics with LED ribbons while torrential rain pours down.
[[Director note: Fast shutter 45 degrees, match cut on downbeat, anamorphic flare]]
MARCUS
(singing)
We ignite the neon horizon!

# Bridge

.SUBWAY TUNNEL - DAWN #3#
= Solitary figure bathed in flickering amber emergency beacons, walking toward distant tunnel daylight.
[[Lighting: high contrast sodium vapor haze, keep background silhouettes dark]]
MARCUS
(whispering)
Until the morning breaks the spell.

# Outro

.CITY OVERLOOK - DAWN #4#
= Marcus looks out over the glittering neon skyline as morning sun breaks through the storm clouds.
[[Camera: Extreme wide shot, slow crane up]]
MARCUS
(singing)
The storm gives way to light.
